##Program

The Angular application demonstrates string interpolation. The values stored in the TypeScript component are displayed on the HTML page using double curly brackets {{ }}.

##Output

Student Information

My Name is: Aarti Tonpe

My Course is: M.Sc. Computer Science

My College is: MIT ACSC

##Conclusion

Thus, string interpolation was successfully implemented in an Angular application to display component data on the web page.
